{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Importing the library","anchor":"Importing-the-library","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"AutomixIQ can be imported into your project in one of two ways:","type":"text"}]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Using-CocoaPods","type":"heading","text":"Using CocoaPods:"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the following lines to your podfile","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["source 'https:\/\/github.com\/CocoaPods\/Specs.git'                                                 # Main Pods repository","source 'https:\/\/github.com\/tunedglobal\/tunedglobalpublic-ios.git'                               # Tuned Global's Pods repository","pod 'AutomixIQ'                                                                                 # Using AutomixIQ"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Manually importing the AutomixIQ framework","level":3,"anchor":"Manually-importing-the-AutomixIQ-framework"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you have been provided access to the AutomixIQ.xcframework file, you need to place it somewhere visible to your project, then tell XCode your project links against it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"AutomixIQ depends on ‘nlohmann_json’ library, version 3.5.0, which is open source and can be procured from https:\/\/github.com\/nlohmann\/json.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Using-AutomixIQ-in-your-code","text":"Using AutomixIQ in your code","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To start using AutomixIQ, simply import the module:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import AutomixIQ"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Objective-C"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"objective-c","code":["#import <AutomixIQ\/AutomixIQ-umbrella.h>"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"conte